# ---- Secret envelope hub token (BH-7964, BH-7937.0) ----
# The hub's credential for GET /api/secrets/envelope/<id> on the jobs worker,
# sent as header x-envelope-hub-token on top of HARNESS_SECRET. Set it in the
# HUB env only (/etc/harness/env/global.env), never on a box or a lane-run
# machine. The same value is the jobs worker secret ENVELOPE_HUB_TOKEN
# (`wrangler secret put ENVELOPE_HUB_TOKEN --name harness-jobs`). Unset or blank
# on the worker = the read answers 503 and no ciphertext leaves the worker.
#ENVELOPE_HUB_TOKEN=
